.TH QUIPU-MIGRATE-VECTORS 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-migrate\-vectors \- Move stored vectors between backends (lancedb feature)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu migrate\-vectors\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move stored vectors between backends (lancedb feature)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Source vector backend
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Destination vector backend
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview the operation without applying it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
